        <Param val="Welcome. This experiment studies how words influence each other.&amp;#10;On each trial you will first see a word briefly, followed by another string of letters.&amp;#10;Decide whether the target is a &quot;REAL&quot; English word or NOT a real word.&amp;#10;Press 'm' if the target is a &quot;Word&quot;. Press 'z' if the target is a &quot;Non-word&quot;.&amp;#10;Try to respond as quickly and accurately as possible. You will do a short practice first. Press SPACE to begin.&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
